msgstr ":mod:`time` 模块涵盖阻塞延时、单调计时和耗时测量::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:694
msgid "Virtual timers"
msgstr "虚拟定时器"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:696
msgid ""
":ref:`machine.Timer <machine.Timer>` schedules periodic or one‑shot "
"callbacks without consuming a hardware timer slot. Pass ``-1`` as the id to "
"use a virtual (software) timer::"
msgstr ""
":ref:`machine.Timer <machine.Timer>` 可在不占用硬件定时器槽的情况下调度周期性或一次性回调。将 ``-1`` 作为 "
"id 传入即可使用虚拟（软件）定时器::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:710
msgid ""
"Period values are in milliseconds. Call :meth:`~machine.Timer.deinit` to "
"stop and release the slot."
msgstr "周期值以毫秒为单位。调用 :meth:`~machine.Timer.deinit` 可停止并释放该槽。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:714
msgid "Real‑time clock"
msgstr "实时时钟"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:716
msgid ""
":ref:`machine.RTC <machine.RTC>` keeps wall‑clock time across resets and "
"(with the optional 3.3 V backup battery wired to the rear pads, see *Power "
"pins*) across full power loss::"
msgstr ""
":ref:`machine.RTC <machine.RTC>` 可在复位之间，以及（在后部焊盘接上可选的 3.3 V 备用电池后，参见 "
"*电源引脚*\\ ）在完全断电之间保持挂钟时间::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:726
msgid ""
"The RTC also runs through deep sleep, so you can use it as a wakeup source "
"for :func:`machine.deepsleep`."
msgstr "RTC 在深度睡眠期间也会继续运行，因此你可以将其用作 :func:`machine.deepsleep` 的唤醒源。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:730
msgid "Watchdog"
msgstr "看门狗"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:732
msgid ""
":ref:`machine.WDT <machine.WDT>` resets the board if the application hangs. "
"Once started it can't be stopped or reconfigured — feed it periodically "
"inside your main loop::"
msgstr ""
":ref:`machine.WDT <machine.WDT>` 会在应用程序卡死时复位开发板。一旦启动便无法停止或重新配置 —— "
"请在主循环内定期对其喂狗::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:744
msgid "Boot and runtime info"
msgstr "启动与运行时信息"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:747
msgid "USB bootloader window"
msgstr "USB 引导加载程序窗口"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:749
msgid ""
"On every power‑up the camera runs a short bootloader (a few seconds) that "
"lets OpenMV IDE update the firmware without the user having to enter DFU "
"mode. After the window expires the bootloader hands off to ``boot.py`` and "
"then ``main.py``."
msgstr ""
"每次上电时，摄像头都会运行一段短暂的引导加载程序（几秒钟），让 OpenMV IDE 无需用户进入 DFU "
"模式即可更新固件。窗口期结束后，引导加载程序会移交给 ``boot.py``\\ ，然后是 ``main.py``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:754
msgid ""
"A running script can re‑enter the bootloader on demand by calling "
":func:`machine.bootloader`::"
msgstr "正在运行的脚本可以通过调用 :func:`machine.bootloader` 按需重新进入引导加载程序::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:762
msgid "Filesystem and boot order"
msgstr "文件系统与启动顺序"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:764
msgid "The RT1062 firmware mounts up to three filesystems on boot:"
msgstr "RT1062 固件在启动时最多挂载三个文件系统："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:766
msgid ""
"**Internal flash** — always mounted at ``/flash``. Holds ``main.py`` and "
"``README.txt`` by default; created on the very first boot."
msgstr ""
"**内部 flash** —— 始终挂载在 ``/flash``\\ 。默认保存 ``main.py`` 和 ``README.txt``\\ "
"；在首次启动时创建。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:768
msgid "**microSD card** — if a card is inserted it is mounted at ``/sdcard``."
msgstr "**microSD 卡** —— 如果插入了卡，它会挂载在 ``/sdcard``\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:770
msgid ""
"**ROMFS** — read‑only, memory‑mapped filesystem at ``/rom`` used to ship "
"large data assets (e.g. AI models) that benefit from zero‑copy access. "
"Mounted automatically by MicroPython at startup, before any user Python "
"runs."
msgstr ""
"**ROMFS** —— 位于 ``/rom`` 的只读、内存映射文件系统，用于装载受益于零拷贝访问的大型数据资源（例如 AI 模型）。由 "
"MicroPython 在启动时、在任何用户 Python 运行之前自动挂载。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:775
msgid ""
"After mounting, the working directory is set to ``/sdcard`` when the card is"
" present, otherwise ``/flash``. The interpreter then runs scripts from that "
"directory:"
msgstr "挂载完成后，当存在卡时工作目录被设为 ``/sdcard``\\ ，否则为 ``/flash``\\ 。然后解释器会从该目录运行脚本："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:779
msgid ""
"``boot.py`` is executed on **every** soft reset (cold boot, ``Ctrl‑D`` from "
"the REPL, or whenever the running script returns)."
msgstr "``boot.py`` 在\\ **每次**\\ 软复位时执行（冷启动、从 REPL 按 ``Ctrl‑D``\\ ，或每当正在运行的脚本返回时）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:781
msgid ""
"``main.py`` is executed **only on cold boot**, immediately after "
"``boot.py``. Subsequent soft resets re‑run ``boot.py`` but drop straight to "
"the REPL — to re‑run ``main.py`` you have to fully reset the board."
msgstr ""
"``main.py`` **仅在冷启动时**\\ 执行，紧接在 ``boot.py`` 之后。后续的软复位会重新运行 ``boot.py``\\ "
"，但会直接进入 REPL —— 要重新运行 ``main.py``\\ ，你必须完全复位开发板。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:786
msgid ""
"Dropping a ``boot.py`` or ``main.py`` onto the SD card overrides the copy in"
" flash without touching it — both files are looked up in the boot directory "
"(``/sdcard`` when the card is mounted, otherwise ``/flash``)."
msgstr ""
"将 ``boot.py`` 或 ``main.py`` 放到 SD 卡上，会覆盖 flash 中的副本而不触碰它 —— "
"这两个文件都在启动目录中查找（挂载了卡时为 ``/sdcard``\\ ，否则为 ``/flash``\\ ）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:791
msgid ""
"The default ``main.py`` shipped on a freshly flashed board just blinks the "
"user RGB LED's **blue** channel as a heartbeat (two short pulses, short "
"gap), so you can tell the firmware booted cleanly without any host attached."
msgstr ""
"刚刷写好的开发板上随附的默认 ``main.py`` 只是将用户 RGB LED 的\\ **蓝色**\\ "
"通道作为心跳进行闪烁（两次短脉冲，短间隔），这样你无需连接任何主机即可判断固件已正常启动。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:796
msgid ""
"``sys.path`` is extended to include all three filesystems and their ``lib/``"
" subdirectories, so importable modules can live in ``/flash/lib``, "
"``/sdcard/lib``, or ``/rom/lib``."
msgstr ""
"``sys.path`` 被扩展以包含全部三个文件系统及其 ``lib/`` 子目录，因此可导入的模块可以存放在 ``/flash/lib``\\ "
"、\\ ``/sdcard/lib`` 或 ``/rom/lib`` 中。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:800
msgid ""
"To force the system to ignore an inserted SD card (for example to run the "
"flash ``main.py`` even with a card present), create an empty file named "
"``SKIPSD`` at the root of ``/flash``."
msgstr ""
"若要强制系统忽略已插入的 SD 卡（例如即使存在卡也运行 flash 中的 ``main.py``\\ ），请在 ``/flash`` "
"根目录创建一个名为 ``SKIPSD`` 的空文件。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:804
msgid ""
"When connected over USB, the boot filesystem (``/sdcard`` if a card is "
"present, otherwise ``/flash``) also enumerates as a USB mass‑storage drive "
"on the host, letting you edit ``boot.py``, ``main.py``, and any other files "
"directly. **Eject the drive before resetting the camera** so the host "
"flushes its cached writes."
msgstr ""
"通过 USB 连接时，启动文件系统（存在卡时为 ``/sdcard``\\ ，否则为 ``/flash``\\ ）也会在主机上枚举为一个 USB "
"大容量存储驱动器，让你可以直接编辑 ``boot.py``\\ 、\\ ``main.py`` 及任何其他文件。\\ "
"**在复位摄像头前请先弹出驱动器**\\ ，以便主机刷新其缓存的写入。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:812
msgid ""
"Because the OS treats the drive as a passive block device, files created or "
"modified by code running on the OpenMV Cam will not show up until the host "
"re‑mounts the drive. If both the OS and the OpenMV Cam write the same "
"filesystem at the same time, the OS will win and overwrite changes made by "
"the camera. Use the SD card for any data the script writes back, and remount"
" before reading those files from the host."
msgstr ""
"由于操作系统将该驱动器视为被动的块设备，由 OpenMV Cam 上运行的代码创建或修改的文件，在主机重新挂载该驱动器之前不会显示。如果操作系统和 "
"OpenMV Cam 同时写入同一文件系统，操作系统会占上风并覆盖摄像头所做的更改。脚本写回的任何数据请使用 SD "
"卡，并在从主机读取这些文件前重新挂载。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:822
msgid ""
"The user RGB LED's **red** channel may briefly light up while the host is "
"reading from or writing to the USB mass‑storage drive — this is a "
"firmware‑driven activity indicator, not a fault."
msgstr ""
"当主机正在从 USB 大容量存储驱动器读取或向其写入时，用户 RGB LED 的\\ **红色**\\ 通道可能会短暂点亮 —— "
"这是固件驱动的活动指示，而非故障。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:827
msgid "Storage sizes"
msgstr "存储容量"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:829
msgid "The RT1062 ships with:"
msgstr "RT1062 随附："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:831
msgid "``/flash`` — **4 MB** FAT filesystem, read/write."
msgstr "``/flash`` —— **4 MB** FAT 文件系统，可读写。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:832
msgid ""
"``/rom`` — **8 MB** read-only memory-mapped ROMFS, used to ship scripts and "
"ML models that benefit from zero-copy mmap access."
msgstr "``/rom`` —— **8 MB** 只读内存映射 ROMFS，用于装载受益于零拷贝 mmap 访问的脚本和 ML 模型。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:835
msgid ""
"``/sdcard`` — full size of whatever microSD card is inserted (when present),"
" read/write."
msgstr "``/sdcard`` —— 已插入的 microSD 卡（如果存在）的完整容量，可读写。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:839
msgid "Hard‑fault indicator"
msgstr "硬故障指示"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:841
msgid ""
"If the user RGB LED is rapidly cycling through all colours — fast enough "
"that it tends to look like a **twinkling white LED** rather than distinct "
"hues — the firmware has hit an unrecoverable hard fault. Reflash the "
"firmware to recover; if reflashing doesn't help, the board may be physically"
" damaged."
msgstr ""
"如果用户 RGB LED 在所有颜色之间快速循环 —— 快到看起来更像一颗\\ **闪烁的白色 LED** 而非各自分明的色调 —— "
"那么固件已遇到不可恢复的硬故障。重新刷写固件即可恢复；如果重新刷写也无济于事，开发板可能已物理损坏。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:848
msgid "Software libraries"
msgstr "软件库"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:850
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`library index </library/index>` for the full list of modules —"
" including which ones are unique to the RT1062 build."
msgstr "完整的模块列表（包括哪些是 RT1062 构建版本独有的）请参见 :doc:`库索引 </library/index>`\\ 。"
